        <mxCell id="HYzRC4N9WjUmbwJ38pO1-1" value="The &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;track&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; expression allows Angular to maintain a &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;relationship&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; between your &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;data&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; and the &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;DOM nodes&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; on the page.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This allows Angular to &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;optimize performance&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; by executing the minimum necessary DOM operations when the data changes.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;spacingLeft=3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
