        <mxCell id="HYzRC4N9WjUmbwJ38pO1-4" value="For &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;static collections&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; that never change, you can use &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;$index&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; to tell Angular to track each item by its index in the collection." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;spacingLeft=3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
