        <mxCell id="UXTe15T1eyuMNEUT1H_h-2" value="While optional, &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;certain triggers&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; may require the presence of either a &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;@placeholder&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; or a &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;template reference&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; variable to function." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1">
