        <mxCell id="EPgjI7OVuLiAbaIIqSfn-22" value="@loading accepts two parameters:&lt;div&gt;- &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000cc&quot;&gt;minimum&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: The minimum amount of time the content should be shown (&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;minimum duration&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000cc&quot;&gt;after&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: the the amount of time to wait after loading begins before showing the loading template (&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;minimum initial delay&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;The timers for both parameters begin immediately after the loading has been triggered.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
